flowchart TD
    Failure["Failure or missing evidence"] --> Classify{ "Classify failure" }
    Classify -->|timeout / transient network| Retry{ "Retry budget available?" }
    Retry -->|yes| RetryCall["Retry with bounded backoff"]
    Retry -->|no| ReadOnly["Stop mutations; use read-only cache"]
    Classify -->|invalid input / policy denied| Reject["Reject and explain"]
    Classify -->|invalid readback| Quarantine["Quarantine result and preserve evidence"]
    Classify -->|mutation mismatch| Freeze["Freeze follow-up mutations"]
    Classify -->|unknown| Stop["Safe stop and escalate"]
    Classify -->|provider unavailable| LocalCache["Local stale read-only fixture"]
    RetryCall --> Evidence["Fresh readback"]
    Evidence -->|valid| Continue["Continue with typed response"]
    Evidence -->|invalid| Quarantine
    ReadOnly --> Audit["Audit fallback"]
    LocalCache --> Audit
    Reject --> Audit
    Quarantine --> Audit
    Freeze --> Audit
    Stop --> Audit
